WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.093 --> 00:00:22.229
This is a brand-new iPad, with Matdo Check just installed.

2
00:00:22.229 --> 00:00:28.761
It has found this center’s backups already in your iCloud.

3
00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:34.896
There is nothing to import and no CSV to carry across.

4
00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:41.901
Pick the day you want to come back from.

5
00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:48.276
The backup is encrypted, so it asks for the instructor PIN.

6
00:00:48.276 --> 00:00:58.881
If the PIN was forgotten, the recovery code works here instead.

7
00:00:58.881 --> 00:01:04.973
Tap Unlock Backup.

8
00:01:04.973 --> 00:01:11.844
Before anything is replaced, it tells you what is inside.

9
00:01:11.844 --> 00:01:18.616
The center, the attendees, and how many attendance records.

10
00:01:18.616 --> 00:01:25.387
Tap Restore This Backup.

11
00:01:25.387 --> 00:01:32.843
It downloads from iCloud. A large backup takes a while on Wi-Fi.

12
00:01:32.843 --> 00:01:39.777
Cancelling is safe — iCloud keeps what it has already fetched.

13
00:01:39.777 --> 00:01:48.367
Your PIN comes back with the data, so instructors carry on as before.
